Table 2 summarizes the overall performance of all models on the CellPuzzles test set. We compare open-source LLMs (e.g., Llama [34], Qwen [42]), closed-source LLMs with strong reasoning capabilities (e.g., GPT-4o [33], o1 ), and instruction-tuned baselines that directly predict answers from the input without producing reasoning traces. More details are in the Supplementary Materials.

